# Exported symbol list for the macOS renderer modules (-Wl,-exported_symbols_list).
#
# Darwin peer of tools/build/linux_renderer_module.map. The macOS client keeps
# its statically linked OpenGL renderer, so a loaded renderer module carries a
# second copy of the renderer, idlib, imagetools and render_geo symbols. Only
# the module entry point may be exported; anything else risks the two copies
# interposing on each other at dlopen time.
#
# Leading underscore is the Mach-O C symbol decoration.
_GetRenderAPI
# openQ4_Mem_GetModuleStats is the one deliberate addition. It is not an
# interposition hazard: nothing inside either binary calls it, so there are no
# references that could bind to the wrong copy. It exists only to be found by
# name from the loader, which asks a specific module handle for it so that the
# engine's memory total can include that module's own idlib counters.
_openQ4_Mem_GetModuleStats
